    "Also save location in notes" : {

    },
    "Also writes the location as an extra line at the end of the transaction's notes. Hotaru hides that line, but the web interface and other apps show it as plain text.\n\nTurn this on if your server runs Firefly III older than 6.7.0: those versions save a location when a transaction is created but drop it when it's edited, and the notes line keeps it safe. It also keeps the place name and accuracy, which Firefly III doesn't store.\n\nTransactions that already have the line always show their location, whether this is on or off." : {

    },
